{"path":"ranges/zip_transform_view/end","title":"std::ranges::zip_transform_view<F,Views...>::end","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::ranges::zip_transform_view&lt;F,Views...&gt;::</span>end","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/end","section":"ranges","kind":"page","summary":"Returns an iterator or a sentinel that compares equal to the end iterator of the zip_transform_view.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"kw4\">auto</span> end<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"kw4\">const</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; requires <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range\"><span class=\"kw2916\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*InnerView*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"sy3\">&amp;&amp;</span><br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/concepts/invocable\"><span class=\"kw2977\">std::<span class=\"me2\">regular_invocable</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> F<span class=\"sy3\">&amp;</span>,<br>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/range_reference_t\"><span class=\"kw2913\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">range_reference_t</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> Views<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span>...<span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx23\">(since C++23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Returns an <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/iterator\">iterator</a> or a <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/sentinel\">sentinel</a> that compares equal to the end iterator of the <a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view\"><code>zip_transform_view</code></a>.\n</p><p>Let <code>zip_</code> denote the underlying tuple of views:\n</p>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">1)</span> Equivalent to: <br><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><span class=\"kw2926\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">common_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"coMULTI\">/*InnerView*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this, zip_.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*sentinel*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">false</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>zip_.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code></div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> Equivalent to: <br><code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">if</span> <span class=\"kw4\">constexpr</span> <span class=\"br0\">(</span><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/common_range\"><span class=\"kw2926\">ranges::<span class=\"me2\">common_range</span></span></a><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw4\">const</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*InnerView*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*iterator*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"sy2\">*</span>this, zip_.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span><br>\n<span class=\"kw1\">else</span><br>\n&nbsp; &nbsp; <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> <span class=\"coMULTI\">/*sentinel*/</span><span class=\"sy1\">&lt;</span><span class=\"kw2\">true</span><span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>zip_.<span class=\"me1\">end</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></code></div>\n<h3 id=\"Parameters\">Parameters</h3>\n<p>(none)\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Return_value\">Return value</h3>\n<p>An iterator or sentinel representing the end of the <code>zip_transform_view</code>, as described above.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-notice\">This section is incomplete<br>Reason: no example </div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/zip_transform_view/begin\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>begin</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  returns an iterator to the beginning <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td> <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/ranges/end\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>ranges::end</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td> returns a sentinel indicating the end of a range<br><span class=\"t-mark\">(customization point object)</span></td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"ranges","title":"Ranges library (since C++20)"},{"path":"ranges/zip_transform_view","title":"std::ranges::views::zip_transform, std::ranges::zip_transform_view"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::ranges::zip_transform_view<F,Views...>::end","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"2 declarations; revisions: since C++23. Returns an iterator or a sentinel that compares equal to the end iterator of the zip_transform_view."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"An iterator or sentinel representing the end of the zip_transform_view, as described above."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"begin","note":"returns an iterator to the beginning"},{"label":"ranges::end","note":"returns a sentinel indicating the end of a range"}]}]},"standards":["C++20","C++23"],"wordCount":118,"codeBlockCount":0}
